    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d255">

                <pb facs="0590" n="552" sameAs="frus:frus1964-68v26/pg552"/>

                <head>255. Memorandum From the President’s Special Assistant (Rostow) to President
                        Johnson<anchor n="1" xml:id="d255-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1968-04-24T15:40:00-05:00">April 24, 1968, 3:40 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Possibility of wheat sales to Indonesia</item>
                </list>
                <p>President Suharto and the rest of the Indonesian leadership are now very
                    concerned about their economic problems. Suharto has indicated to our Ambassador
                    his hope for substantial additional assistance from us, specifically including
                        wheat.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d255-f2"/> The proposal is not firm yet, <pb
                        facs="0591" n="553" xml:id="pg553"/> but it does look as if it may be
                    possible to arrange a sizable PL 480 wheat sale to Indonesia.</p>
                <p>If the Indonesians are as anxious as they appear to be, we should be in a good
                    position to extract from them some good measures to meet the problem of changing
                    a rice-eating society to a wheat-eating society.</p>
                <p>Are you still as anxious as before to move wheat through PL 480 sales?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold"> Walt </hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Yes, follow up with vigor<anchor n="3" xml:id="d255-f3"/>
                        <lb/> Only if the proposal makes sense in international terms<lb/>Call
                        me</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d255-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d255-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Johnson Library, National Security File, Country File, Indonesia, Vol.
                    VIII, 6/67–6/68, [1 of 2]. Confidential.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d255-f2" n="2" xml:id="d255-f2-content">
                <p>As reported in telegram 6116 from Djakarta, April 19. (National Archives and
                    Records Administration, RG 59, Central Files 1967–69, POL 15 INDON)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d255-f3" n="3" xml:id="d255-f3-content">
                <p>The President checked this option and underlined “vigor” twice. He also wrote:
                    “promptly—Report back soonest.”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
